
~ title

Morning

=> END


~ start

You awake.
	#You have 2 morning actions.
#set EventManager.temp["wew"] = 10

=> action


~ action

- Eat meal
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.FOOD, 1) and EventManager.temp["eat_meal"] == false
		set EventManager.temp["eat_meal"] = true
		Game.inventory.remove( Items.FOOD, 1 )
		Game.player.apply_stat( StatType.HUNGER, 40 )
		You eat some food
	else
		You have no food.
	=> action
#- Rest => action
- Leave => END

=> END